  "content": {
    "text": "96\n\n Thanks, Sara!\u00a0\nLast week, I sent out a one-question survey and the answers were more surprising than I expected.\nSo thank you for giving me your insights. I realized a lot of people are getting mixed messages and are frustrated with the process of buying a firm.\nBuying a firm doesn\u2019t have to be this way.\u00a0\nAnd you can absolutely make sense of the process with the right information.\nI wanted to share with you our Weekly Wine Down episodes to help you get started on that. \nI know you and I both want focused support on buying a firm, and I hope this helps you get started and feeling confident about it.\nBest,\nSara Sharp\nDeal Attorney, Partner\nSK&S Law Group\nPS. Curious about that one-question survey? I\u2019d love for you to take 60 seconds and tell me your thoughts right here.\n\n Copyright \u00a9 2024\u00a0 Someday Consultants, All rights reserved. \n\n Our e-mail address is:\ninfo@dealacademy.org\n\n Want to change how you receive these emails?\n You can unsubscribe from this list.",
