formation.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">I wanted to </span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://link.msgsndr.com/email-tracking/14b7aee6a7e?contactId=xoXEjJhxZU4nfwkScSXn&amp;v=h6oPSxNmPm4&amp;list=PLD9UYub3Sa1Xx2STC0DwKxuXtbxr6Gk-i\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 164, 189); font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 164, 189)\"><strong>share with you our Weekly Wine Down episodes</strong></span></a><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"> to help you get started on that. </span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">I know you and I both want focused support on buying a firm, and I hope this helps you get started and feeling confident about it.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px\">Best,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px\">Sara Sharp</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 16px\">Deal Attorney, Partner</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 16px\">SK&amp;S Law Group</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">PS. Curious about that one-question survey? I\u2019d love for you to take 60 seconds and </span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://link.msgsndr.com/email-tracking/bf2b2b449dc?contactId=xoXEjJhxZU4nfwkScSXn\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 164, 189); font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 164, 189)\"><strong>tell me your thoughts right here.</strong></span></a></p></div>\n    \n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            \n              <tr>\n                <td align=\"center\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-top:10px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:20px;word-break:break-word;\">\n                  \n      \n     <!--[if mso | IE]><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" ><tr><td><![endif]-->\n              <table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" sty